---
description: Three.js performance budget for hack-and-slash combat
globs: src/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Stay at 60

- Cap pixel ratio at 2. Prefer `powerPreference: 'high-performance'`.
- Pool enemies, slashes, and sparks. No `new Mesh` / `new Vector3` in the hot loop.
- Share geometries and materials. Instance identical fodder if a wave is large.
- Visual meshes are not colliders. Rapier capsules/boxes only.
- Dev overlay (`stats.js`, `renderer.info`, entity counts) stays behind `import.meta.env.DEV`.
- If a frame hitch shows up, measure update vs render before adding more effects.

```ts
// BAD
function update() {
  const dir = new THREE.Vector3(1, 0, 0);
}

// GOOD
const _dir = new THREE.Vector3();
function update() {
  _dir.set(1, 0, 0);
}
```
